- improvement: the AFK timeout is reset on real user activity only (QML 2.1.6 parity)
- improvement: ignoring a player also hides their emoji reactions
- improvement: light mode surfaces aligned with PokerTH 2.1.6 - grey page, white content boxes
- improvement: music and sounds survive iOS audio interruptions and network handovers
- improvement: proxy hardening mirroring the upstream server fixes - bounded send queues, ingress validation, avatar decode limits, TLS public-key pinning
- improvement: optional search-engine layer (admin-controlled, off by default) with server-rendered rules and FAQ pages
- bugfix: an intended check could turn into a call when a raise arrived at the same moment (QML 2.1.6 parity)
- bugfix: a pre-armed Check/Call no longer fires as an unintended call after a late raise
- bugfix: connecting in training mode no longer overwrites the remembered LAN server settings
- bugfix: stray background bands in the installed PWA on iOS and iPadOS

